    "answer": {
      "short": "$99^\\circ$",
      "worked": "The largest angle is opposite the $21\\text{ m}$ side.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\theta&=\\frac{17^2+10^2-21^2}{2(17)(10)}\\\\[8pt]\\theta&=\\cos^{-1}\\left(-\\frac{13}{85}\\right)\\\\[8pt]\\theta&\\approx99^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
